'''Introducing Eye of Zomm 1.0'''

Eye of Zomm (EoZ) is a desktop companion for EverQuest Legends, available for Windows and Linux. It combines your game log with EQLWiki information to put useful tools beside your game.

''' PLEASE NOTE: This is a feature-rich, somewhat experimental tool. Please review everything, critique certain flows, find gaps, and report them in discord.'''

=== What can you do with EoZ? ===

* '''Arrange your workspace.''' Move, resize and dock small panels around your game window. Keep your map, combat reports and reminders where you want them, then lock your layout in place.
* '''Explore and find loot.''' Browse 2D and 3D maps, display your logged position, and look up notable enemies and their drops. '''Crawl''' mode helps track which notable enemies you have defeated during a dungeon run.
* '''Understand your fights.''' Review damage, damage per second, healing and damage taken for combatants recorded in your log. Explore individual fights or your whole session, and track the alternate advancement points you gain.
* '''Create alerts and reminders.''' Turn game log messages into custom sound or speech alerts, and set countdowns to keep track of important timings while you play.
* '''Keep and share your characters.''' Import equipped gear, review character stats, browse items and preview tier upgrades. Save an inspect image or share an interactive character sheet on your wiki user page.
* '''Help build the wiki.''' Contribute item details, loot sources and NPC locations discovered on your adventures. Optional examine-window reading helps fill out item forms, and Contribution History lets you review and edit your submissions.

=== Wiki updates since October 23 ===

* '''Improved item previews:''' more accurate tier calculations for Backstab, weapon Accuracy and weight.
* '''Better loot links:''' item and NPC pages connect drops and their sources more consistently, including normal and raid loot.
* '''Clickable coordinates:''' waypoint links copy a ready-to-paste <code>/way</code> command for use in the game.

