To get started, install EoZ, choose your game folder and enable game logging. The setup guide walks you through connecting your character and arranging your panels. Questions and feedback are welcome in [https://discord.com/channels/1435786469968183456/1521564179587268649 the wiki Discord].

== 10/23/2026 ==

A few useful wiki updates are now live!
* '''Edit Consolidation:''' The single '''Edit''' button opens the source editor. The regular editor was breaking stuff. Might add a toggle within the page if demand arises.
* '''A header that stays with you:''' Search, page actions, and your account menu remain within reach while you scroll.
* '''Your own todo list:''' Click the new icon when mousing over a page title or section heading and confirm to add it.
Each entry links back to its source, and you can collapse it, mark it complete, or remove it.
New icon replaces the watchlist icon in the main bar. Watchlist remains available in your user menu.

When you're logged out, your todo list stays in this browser. When you're logged in, it saves to your wiki account. These are separate lists; signing in does not copy your logged-out list into your account.

* '''Search selected text:''' Highlight a short piece of article text, then choose '''Search wiki''' to search for it.
* '''Partial title searches:''' Submitting a partial name such as '''Raku''' now finds [[Rakusha Cloak]] in the search results.

Please report feedback in [https://discord.com/channels/1435786469968183456/1521564179587268649 the wiki Discord].

