== 10/8/2026 ==

Hi everyone! Good news update. 

* Talk pages now accept logged-out contributions, credited to your public IP. Article editing still requires an account with a confirmed email. The green Talk counter shows changes since your last visit in this browser.

* Search shrinks more smoothly, and page actions stay visible on mobile. Talk sits before Read with a small divider (these are two different pages for each URL, while read, edit, edit source, etc are modifiers on one view or the other. Sorry for the confusion!)

* Icon Finder has easier icon/ID copying and more results. 

* Sky reward numerical values on the Plane of Sky quest list save more reliably. Probably. Log in and it works fine :)

* Spell level caps scale with rank, ranged weapons/ammo gain range with upgrades, and weapon damage bonuses now show on weapons. They calculate via the formula for level 50 unless an override is provided.

The wiki's code recently moved to [https://github.com/Maergoth/EQLWiki GitHub]! You can [https://github.com/Maergoth/EQLWiki/issues submit code issues] for bugs or feature ideas. Article corrections still belong on the wiki. General wiki issues go on discord.

Want to contribute code or help test? Ask in [https://discord.com/channels/1435786469968183456/1521564179587268649 the wiki Discord] for contributor and test server access. Will select people eventually.

